sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant M as Conversation Manager
    participant W as AI Agent Worker
    participant L as LLM/Tool Loop
    participant T as Business Tool

    C->>M: Incoming Message
    M->>W: HandleConversationEvent
    W->>W: 去重、状态/身份/轮次检查
    W->>L: Prompt + History + ToolContext
    loop 最多 maxSteps
        L->>T: Tool Call
        T-->>L: Tool Result
    end
    L-->>W: Answer + Outcome
    W->>M: 重新读取 Conversation
    alt 人工已接管或状态不可处理
        W-->>W: 丢弃本轮输出
    else Handoff 已执行
        W-->>W: 不再发 AI 文本
    else 正常回答
        W->>M: QueueReply(ai_assistant user)
        opt Confirmation
            W->>M: QueueReply(is_confirmation=true)
        end
        opt Resolve
            W->>M: UpdateConversationStatus(resolved)
        end
    end
